e=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rikki’s style simulates the complex maneuvers she makes with her tail to collect panties. Drag the coin through the maze, collect the keys to open the door, and drop the coin into the treasure chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953380/extras/830fd53f12219744d3dfaa978add2c96.poster.avif?t=1788939805\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953380/extras/830fd53f12219744d3dfaa978add2c96.webm?t=1788939805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953380/extras/830fd53f12219744d3dfaa978add2c96.mp4?t=1788939805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill up your panty collection in each stage. Each character has their own Legendary panty that reflects a portion of their personality. Mizu, Sasa, and Rikki each have their own variety of legendary panties they can find, so mastering all the styles of play is needed to complete the collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953380/extras/7e1164289ca73eb600a259e3ef843080.avif?t=1788939805\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953380/extras_big/7e1164289ca73eb600a259e3ef843080.webp?t=1788939805 width=1560 height=726 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each panty, based on rarity, will earn you panty points. These panty points can be redeemed to increase your level, which will unlock more stages and more outfits for your member to buy. Check the leaderboard to determine your rank in Atty's Secret Base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build your own member in Atty’s Secret Base, and you can currently use your member to stop thieves from stealing your properly stolen panties! More features will be coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953380/extras/deec3adbb9bbfdee8dd34516adf946ea.avif?t=1788939805\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953380/extras_big/deec3adbb9bbfdee8dd34516adf946ea.webp?t=1788939805 width=1560 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FREE. PICK UP, PLAY, PUT DOWN.</strong>Free to play and built for short sessions — a few minutes in a queue, a proper run on the couch. Progress syncs across Steam, iOS, and Android, so you can start on your phone and finish at your desk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hentai. No nudity. Just very cute panty crime.</p>",
